  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n25% of k = 10 less than 1800% of 10\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nx% of y = (x × y) ÷ 100\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 25% of k = 1800% of 10 − 10\n\n⇒ (25 × k) ÷ 100 = (1800 × 10) ÷ 100 − 10\n\n⇒ k ÷ 4 = 180 − 10\n\n⇒ k ÷ 4 = 170\n\n⇒ k = 170 × 4 = 680\n\n**∴ k = __680__**",
